BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:22-for-22q-walkrunride-2026-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260614T100000Z
DTEND:20260614T140000Z
SUMMARY:2.2 for 22q Walk/Run/Ride 2026
DESCRIPTION:A walk/run/ride event running June 6–14\, 2026 to raise awareness and funds for 22q (22q11.2 deletion syndrome)\, the second most common genetic disorder after Down Syndrome. Includes virtual participation options (2.2 mile\, 5K\, half marathon\, marathon\, 10-mile bike ride\, 20-mile bike ride) taking place anywhere June 6–14\, and an in-person event in Erie\, CO on June 14\, 2026 from 10:00 AM–2:00 PM MDT featuring 2.2 mile and 5K distances. Hosted by The 22q Family Foundation.
LOCATION:Erie\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
