DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260621T050000Z
DTEND:20260621T090000Z
SUMMARY:Estes Park Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Ranked 'top 7 Most Scenic half marathon in the USA' by Forbes Magazine. The Estes Park Marathon features multiple distance options including a full marathon\, half marathon\, and Longs Peak 5K. Marathon and Half Marathon start at the Dao House (6120 CO Highway 7) with rolling starts. The 5K starts northeast of Estes Park High School. All participants receive finisher medals\, and age group awards are provided for multiple categories.
LOCATION:Estes Park High School\, Estes Park\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-marathon-and-heavy-half-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260626T080000Z
DTEND:20260626T120000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail Marathon and Heavy Half
DESCRIPTION:A high-altitude marathon starting at 10\,200 feet and climbing to 13\,185 feet at Mosquito Pass. It is part of the legendary Leadville Race Series and is known for its extreme elevation and mining-town history.
LOCATION:6th and Harrison\, Leadville\, CO 80461
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-marathon-heavy-half-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260627T063000Z
DTEND:20260627T103000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail Marathon & Heavy Half
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Leadville Trail Marathon and Heavy Half presented by La Sportiva takes trail runners through the historic mining district's challenging trails to the highest point of any Leadville Race Series event: Mosquito Pass (13\,185 feet). The marathon is 26.4 miles of out-and-back dirt roads and single track; the Heavy Half is 15.46 miles along the same path minus the Ball Mountain section. General Registration is SOLD OUT; waitlist available. Marathon starts at 6:30 AM\, Heavy Half starts at 9:00 AM. Awards Ceremony at 4:30 PM.
LOCATION:135 E. 6th Street\, Leadville\, CO 80461
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
