DESCRIPTION:Trail race in beautiful Alderfer/3 Sisters Park offering 5K and 10K courses. Check-in starts at 6am at Wulf Rec Center. EPRD shuttles runners/spectators to The Alderfer Barn. Last shuttle departs at 6:40am. Day of registration increases price by $5.
