DTEND:20260704T130000Z
SUMMARY:July 4th Freedom Run
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independence Day with a classic hometown road run starting and ending at Home Plate Bar & Grill. The Freedom Run 5K/10K features neighborhood routes with directional cones marking the courses. Registration includes participant T-shirt\, finisher medal\, awards in 5-year age brackets\, $5 coupon for food/drinks at Home Plate Bar & Grill\, and professional timing. Post-race celebration with awards\, food\, and drinks.
LOCATION:2571 S Koke Mill Rd\, Springfield\, IL 62704
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
