DESCRIPTION:A 5K run/walk that starts at the Gondola Plaza at Winter Park Resort and winds down the Fraser River Trail\, through green forests and open valleys and the Town of Winter Park\, finishing at the Rendezvous Event Center for an after-party with refreshments\, awards\, and prize giveaways.
