DESCRIPTION:The 12th annual Loveland Liberty 5K hosted by Sweetheart City Racing welcomes both runners and walkers. Features Elite wave (sub-24 min men/sub-26 min women)\, Kids Race (~100 yards)\, and supporting Health4Heroes charity. Race begins at 8:15 AM with packet pickup available July 3rd (5:00-6:30 PM) or race day (7:00 AM).
