BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hardrock-100-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260710T080000Z
DTEND:20260710T120000Z
SUMMARY:Hardrock 100
DESCRIPTION:The Hardrock Hundred Mile Endurance Run is a 100-mile ultramarathon held in the San Juan Mountains of Colorado\, featuring 33\,264 feet of climb and 33\,264 feet of descent (66\,528 feet total elevation change)\, with an average elevation of 11\,186 feet\, a low point of 7\,680 feet (Ouray)\, and a high point of 14\,048 feet (Handies Peak). The 2026 edition is actively being prepared\, with runner and volunteer manuals published\, Camp Hardrock schedule live\, and race week activities confirmed. Snow conditions are being monitored\, with a notably low snowpack year noted. The race is based in Silverton\, CO.
LOCATION:Silverton\, CO (San Juan Mountains)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:silverheels-trail-runs-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260710T040000Z
DTEND:20260710T080000Z
SUMMARY:Silverheels Trail Runs
DESCRIPTION:Held at an average elevation of over 10\,000 feet\, these races provide expansive views of the South Park Valley and the 'Decalibron' 14ers. The course passes through ghost towns and abandoned mines.
LOCATION:Como Roundhouse\, Como\, CO 80432
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hardrock-hundred-mile-endurance-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260710T080000Z
DTEND:20260710T120000Z
SUMMARY:Hardrock Hundred Mile Endurance Run
DESCRIPTION:100-mile run with 33\,264 feet of climb and 33\,264 feet of descent for a total elevation change of 66\,528 feet with an average elevation of 11\,186 feet. The course traverses the San Juan Mountains with a low point of 7\,680 feet (Ouray) and high point of 14\,048 feet (Handies Peak). The 2026 Runners and Volunteer Manuals are live with race information and logistics available.
LOCATION:Silverton\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-silver-rush-50-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260711T060000Z
DTEND:20260711T100000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Silver Rush 50 Run
DESCRIPTION:The Silver Rush 50 Run is a 50-mile out-and-back ultramarathon with 8\,000 feet of elevation gain featuring technical climbs and descents across Leadville's high-altitude terrain under the shadow of 14\,000-foot Rocky Mountain peaks. Also includes a 15-mile run and 5K junior race. Serves as a qualifying event for the LT100 Run.
LOCATION:Base of Dutch Henry Tubing Hill\, US Highway 24 and McWethy Dr\, Leadville\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cookie-chase-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260711T080000Z
DTEND:20260711T120000Z
SUMMARY:Cookie Chase 5K
DESCRIPTION:The Cookie Chase 5K takes place at Sloan’s Lake Park\, featuring a scenic course on paved bike trails with views of the Rocky Mountains and Denver skyline. Participants receive a race logo shirt\, a finishers medal\, and fresh cookies at the finish line. The event utilizes wave starts based on estimated finish times and is part of the USATF Colorado Grand Prix.
LOCATION:1700 Utica St\, Denver\, CO 80204
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:silver-rush-50-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260712T060000Z
DTEND:20260712T100000Z
SUMMARY:Silver Rush 50 Run
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Silver Rush 50 Run is a high-altitude 50-mile trail race that takes runners through the historic mining district of Leadville. The out-and-back course reaches elevations of over 12\,000 feet and serves as a qualifier for the Leadville Trail 100 Run.
LOCATION:316 Harrison Ave\, Leadville\, CO 80461
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:diplos-run-club-denver-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260712T090000Z
DTEND:20260712T130000Z
SUMMARY:Diplo's Run Club Denver
DESCRIPTION:Diplo's Run Club 5K Run & Rave in Denver. Starting and finishing at Cheesman Park\, this 5K run takes you through one of Denver's most iconic and historic neighborhoods before returning to the park for a post-race concert festival featuring Diplo + friends. Packet pick-up on Saturday\, July 11 at Reelworks\, 1399 35th Street\, Denver\, CO 80205 (10AM–4PM). Race day schedule: 7:00 AM VIP Packet Pick-Up\, 8:00 AM Start Line DJ\, 9:00 AM Race Start\, followed by festival with Diplo performing at 11:00 AM.
LOCATION:Cheesman Park\, Denver\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:high-lonesome-100-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260717T080000Z
DTEND:20260717T120000Z
SUMMARY:High Lonesome 100
DESCRIPTION:A 100-mile high elevation endurance race in the Sawatch Range of the Colorado Rocky Mountains with 23\,500 feet of vertical gain\, reaching 13\,150 feet elevation. The course is a loop through singletrack featuring the National Continental Divide and Colorado Trails\, two ghost towns\, five alpine passes\, remote basins\, and soaring ridges\, completed within 37 hours. Organized by an all-volunteer team as part of Freestone Endurance.
LOCATION:Mount Princeton Hot Springs Resort\, 15870 Co Rd 162\, Nathrop\, CO 81236
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ouray-100-mile-endurance-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260717T080000Z
DTEND:20260717T120000Z
SUMMARY:Ouray 100 Mile Endurance Run
DESCRIPTION:A brutal mountain race with approximately 42\,000 feet of elevation gain for the 100-mile distance. It is known for its steepness and technicality in the heart of the San Juan Mountains.
LOCATION:Fellin Park\, 9th St\, Ouray\, CO 81427
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
