UID:transrockies-run-pass-to-pub-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260719T080000Z
DTEND:20260719T120000Z
SUMMARY:TransRockies Run - Pass to Pub
DESCRIPTION:A multi-day trail running adventure in Colorado spanning 3 days (July 19th-21st\, 2026)\, offered in two distances: Half Pint and Full Pint. Known for its strong community and stunning Rocky Mountain terrain\, TransRockies Run is described as 'the adventure of a lifetime' and includes an accompanying expo event.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
