UID:barr-trail-mountain-race-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260719T070000Z
DTEND:20260719T110000Z
SUMMARY:Barr Trail Mountain Race
DESCRIPTION:A technical trail race starting at 6\,570 feet and climbing to 10\,200 feet at Barr Camp before descending back. It is a premier mountain running event and training ground for Pikes Peak.
