DTSTAMP:20260614T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Rocks! Marathon & Half
DESCRIPTION:The Staunton Rocks! Marathon & Half Marathon is a trail race touring the renowned singletrack of Staunton State Park in Colorado's Front Range Mountains\, southwest of Denver. The marathon covers 26.3 miles with 4\,500ft of vertical gain\, and the half marathon covers 13.1 miles with 2\,200ft of vertical gain. Runners enjoy 60+ mile views\, scenic lakes and streams\, historic buildings\, and wildlife including marmots\, elk\, raptors\, and black bears. Average elevation is 9\,000ft (min 8\,200ft / max 9\,500ft). Course is 90% singletrack and 10% dirt road. Registration caps at 150 per distance. Time limits: Marathon 10 hours\, Half Marathon 9 hours. Includes finisher award\, gender-specific T-shirt\, free race photos\, and a finish line meal.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, Pine\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
